@startuml
title Data Layer: User Entity & Persistence

skinparam linetype ortho
skinparam backgroundColor #FFFFFF

entity "UserEntity" as UserEntity {
  * **localId** : LONG <<PK>>
  --
  * userId    : TEXT
  * fullName  : TEXT
  * embeddingTemplates : BLOB
}

class EmbeddingConverters {
  + embeddingTemplatesToByteArray(value: FaceEmbeddingTemplates?): ByteArray?
  + byteArrayToEmbeddingTemplates(value: ByteArray?): FaceEmbeddingTemplates?
}

UserEntity ..> EmbeddingConverters : <<uses>>

note right of EmbeddingConverters
  Uses ByteBuffer (Little-Endian)
  to serialize FaceEmbeddingTemplates
  into a single BLOB for SQLCipher.
end note

@enduml
